// The marks of the places customers come from, in their own colours, for the Convert scene
// (D-161, the founder's brief of 8 Nov 2026). Each is a 32-unit tile: the mark sits on its own
// colour the way the app icon does, so they read as the real thing. Shapes: Instagram, TikTok and
// WhatsApp are the Simple Icons set (CC0 1.0; the marks are their owners' trademarks), Google's
// G is Devicon's (MIT). Colours are tokens (`--ch-*`) and do not change with the theme. The
// order page and the counter card are ALYR's own, drawn on a Volt tile. Decoration only: the
// names are written beside them.

